Session Map Overview
Session	Type	Chunk	Size
C1-A	Backend	Location Kind + Scan Code	Medium
C1-B	Frontend	Location Kind + Scan Code	Medium
C2-A	Backend	Lot-Level On-Hand View	Small
C2-B	Frontend	Lot Display in Stock Tab	Small
C3-A	Backend	Movement Traceability Fields	Small
C3-B	Frontend	Reason Code + Movement Display	Small
C4-A	Backend	Receipt Documents	Large
C4-B	Frontend	Receipts Page	Large
C5-A	Backend	Dispatch Documents	Large
C5-B	Frontend	Dispatches Page	Large
C6-A	Backend	Count Sessions	Large
C6-B	Frontend	Count Sessions Page	Large
C7-A	Backend	Scan Resolver	Small
C7-B	Frontend	Scan Input + Labels + Form Integration	Medium
C8-A	Backend	Reporting Gaps	Small
C8-B	Frontend	Kind Filter + Document Links	Small
Note: C2-A and C3-A are both tiny. If context budget is tight, merge them into one session. Same for C2-B + C3-B.

Session C1-A — Backend: Location Kind + Scan Code
Prerequisite sessions: None
Complexity: Medium

Context
Tech stack: Spring Boot 3.5 / Java 21 / Hibernate JPA / PostgreSQL / Liquibase. Multi-tenant schema-per-tenant. All entity files are under backend/src/main/java/com/warehouse/warehouse_platform/tenant/. Migrations live in backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/tenant/. Current highest migration is V17__create_f2_inventory_ledger.sql.

The LayoutBlock entity (tenant/warehouse/block/LayoutBlock.java) currently has: id, layoutId, blockTemplateId, parentId, position, side, createdAt, updatedAt. It has no concept of what kind of location it is (storage vs operational area) and no scannable code.

The LayoutBlockService (tenant/warehouse/block/LayoutBlockService.java) handles full tree management: addBlock(), addBlocks(), copySubtree(), moveBlock(), reassignTemplate(), updateMetadata(), removeBlock().

The LayoutBlockController (tenant/warehouse/block/LayoutBlockController.java) exposes PUT /{blockId}/metadata which currently accepts only side via UpdateBlockMetadataRequest.

The InventoryLedgerService.listLocationLookups() builds a LocationLookupItem result that includes a computed pathLabel. This is the only place full path text is assembled — it is not stored.

Deliverables
New file:

tenant/warehouse/block/LocationKind.java — enum: STORAGE, STAGING, QUARANTINE, DAMAGED, DISPATCH, STRUCTURAL
Modified files:

tenant/warehouse/block/LayoutBlock.java

