Session C1-B — Frontend: Location Kind + Scan Code
Prerequisite sessions: C1-A must be deployed/running
Complexity: Medium

Context
Tech stack: React 19, TypeScript, React Router 7, Tailwind, Shadcn/ui, custom i18n (EN/AR via useI18n() hook). All tenant feature code lives under frontend/src/features/tenant/.

Warehouse types are in frontend/src/features/tenant/types/warehouse.ts. The WarehouseBlockResult type currently has: id, layoutId, blockTemplateId, parentId, position, identifier, side, createdAt, updatedAt.

Inventory types are in frontend/src/features/tenant/types/inventory.ts. LocationLookupItem currently has: id, layoutId, layoutName, label, pathLabel, identifier, side.

The warehouse layout builder is in frontend/src/features/tenant/warehouse/WarehouseLayoutsPage.tsx. It renders the block tree and handles metadata updates via the PUT /{blockId}/metadata endpoint.

i18n keys live in frontend/src/i18n/messages/en.ts and ar.ts. Add all new keys to both files.

