Add new query: findOnHandQtyByLocationProductAndLot(@Param("locationId"), @Param("productId"), @Param("lotNumber")) — returns Optional<BigDecimal>, filters by lot_number = :lotNumber (or lot_number IS NULL when lotNumber param is null)
Keep existing findOnHandQtyByLocationAndProduct() — now returns total across all lots (used only for non-lot-tracked products)
