Update OnHandResult record (the DTO returned to the controller) to include lotNumber: String
In transfer() sufficiency check: if the product has trackLot = true, call findOnHandQtyByLocationProductAndLot() instead of the non-lot version
In adjust() negative sufficiency check: same lot-aware check
Update buildOnHandResult() or equivalent mapping method to pass through lotNumber
