Session C3-A — Backend: Movement Traceability Fields
Prerequisite sessions: None (do before C4-A, C5-A, C6-A)
Complexity: Small

Context
StockMovement.java currently has referenceId (UUID, links transfer pairs) and notes. It has no link to a source document (receipt, dispatch, count session) and no reason code. These fields need to exist before receipt/dispatch documents are built so a single migration adds them correctly.

InventoryLedgerService has receive(), transfer(), adjust() methods. Their signatures need to accept the new optional fields so document services (C4-A, C5-A, C6-A) can pass them.

