Session C4-A — Backend: Receipt Documents
Prerequisite sessions: C1-A, C2-A, C3-A
Complexity: Large

Context
There is no receipt document in the codebase. The existing POST /inventory/receive is a raw atomic operation — it stays untouched. Receipts are a new layer on top.

The InventoryLedgerService.receive() method now accepts UUID sourceDocumentId and String reasonCode (after C3-A). When posting a receipt, the service will call receive() once per line, passing the receipt's ID as sourceDocumentId.

Existing permissions are in a TenantPermission enum or similar. You need to add new receipt-specific permissions.

All new files go under tenant/receipt/.

Deliverables
New migration: V21__create_receipt_documents.sql


CREATE TABLE receipt_documents (
  id            UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  supplier_id   UUID REFERENCES suppliers(id),
  reference     VARCHAR(120),
  notes         VARCHAR(500),
  status        VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'DRAFT',
  created_by    VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),
  posted_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,
  posted_by     VARCHAR(255),
  voided_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,
  voided_by     VARCHAR(255)
);

CREATE TABLE receipt_lines (
  id                     UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  receipt_id             UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES receipt_documents(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  product_id             UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES products(id),
  destination_location_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES layout_blocks(id),
  qty                    NUMERIC(15,4) NOT NULL CHECK (qty > 0),
  lot_number             VARCHAR(100),
  expiry_date            DATE,
  notes                  VARCHAR(500),
  position               INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0
);

CREATE INDEX idx_receipt_lines_receipt ON receipt_lines(receipt_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_receipt_docs_status ON receipt_documents(status);
New files:

tenant/receipt/ReceiptStatus.java — enum: DRAFT, POSTED, VOID
tenant/receipt/ReceiptDocument.java — JPA entity mapping receipt_documents
tenant/receipt/ReceiptLine.java — JPA entity mapping receipt_lines
tenant/receipt/ReceiptDocumentRepository.java — JpaRepository<ReceiptDocument, UUID> + findByStatus(ReceiptStatus), paginated list with Specification
tenant/receipt/ReceiptLineRepository.java — JpaRepository<ReceiptLine, UUID> + findByReceiptIdOrderByPosition(UUID)
tenant/receipt/ReceiptService.java (see spec below)
tenant/receipt/ReceiptController.java — base path /{tenantSlug}/receipts
ReceiptService method spec:


createDraft(supplierId?, reference?, notes?, actor)
  → creates ReceiptDocument with status=DRAFT, returns id

addLine(receiptId, productId, destinationLocationId, qty, lotNumber?, expiryDate?, notes?, actor)
  → validates receipt is DRAFT
  → validates product exists + active
  → validates destinationLocationId is a leaf block (has no children) and locationKind != DISPATCH
  → if product.trackLot=true, lotNumber must be provided
  → if product.trackExpiry=true, expiryDate must be provided
  → creates ReceiptLine, appends to end (max position + 1)

removeLine(receiptId, lineId, actor)
  → validates receipt is DRAFT
  → deletes line

updateLine(receiptId, lineId, qty, lotNumber?, expiryDate?, notes?, actor)
  → validates receipt is DRAFT
  → updates mutable fields

postReceipt(receiptId, actor)
  → validates status == DRAFT
  → validates receipt has at least one line
  → for each line: call inventoryLedgerService.receive(locationId, productId, qty, lotNumber, expiryDate, notes, sourceDocumentId=receiptId, reasonCode=null, actor)
  → sets status=POSTED, postedAt, postedBy
  → wraps in @Transactional — if any receive() fails, entire post rolls back

voidReceipt(receiptId, actor)
  → validates status == POSTED
  → for each original line: call inventoryLedgerService.adjust(-line.qty, locationId, productId, lotNumber, sourceDocumentId=receiptId, reasonCode="VOID_RECEIPT", actor)
  → sets status=VOID, voidedAt, voidedBy
  → @Transactional

listReceipts(page, size, status?, search?)
  → paginated, filterable by status and reference/supplier name search

getReceipt(receiptId)
  → returns header + lines
ReceiptController endpoints:


GET    /{tenantSlug}/receipts                  — list (paginated, filterable)
GET    /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}             — get with lines
POST   /{tenantSlug}/receipts                  — createDraft
POST   /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}/lines       — addLine
PUT    /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}/lines/{lid} — updateLine
DELETE /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}/lines/{lid} — removeLine
POST   /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}/post        — postReceipt
POST   /{tenantSlug}/receipts/{id}/void        — voidReceipt
Permissions to add (in existing TenantPermission enum or equivalent):
RECEIPTS_VIEW, RECEIPTS_CREATE, RECEIPTS_EDIT, RECEIPTS_POST, RECEIPTS_VOID

