public StockMovement pick(UUID locationId, UUID productId, BigDecimal qty,
                          String lotNumber, UUID sourceDocumentId, String actor)
Creates a PICK movement with qty negated (stored as negative). Includes sourceDocumentId. Does NOT validate sufficiency (caller is responsible).

DispatchService method spec:


createDraft(destination?, reference?, notes?, actor)

addLine(dispatchId, productId, sourceLocationId, qty, lotNumber?, notes?, actor)
  → validate DRAFT status
  → validate product active, sourceLocationId is leaf and locationKind != STRUCTURAL
  → if product.trackLot=true, lotNumber required

removeLine / updateLine — symmetric with ReceiptService

postDispatch(dispatchId, actor)
  → validate DRAFT, at least one line
  → Pre-flight: for EACH line, check stock sufficiency
      if product.trackLot=true: check (locationId, productId, lotNumber)
      else: check (locationId, productId)
      if ANY line fails → throw with line number and deficit
  → if all pass: for each line call inventoryLedgerService.pick(...)
  → set status=POSTED
  → @Transactional

voidDispatch(dispatchId, actor)
  → validate POSTED
  → for each original line: call inventoryLedgerService.receive(locationId, productId, qty, lotNumber, null, sourceDocumentId=dispatchId, reasonCode="VOID_DISPATCH", actor)
  → set status=VOID
  → @Transactional
Endpoints:


GET    /{tenantSlug}/dispatches
GET    /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}
POST   /{tenantSlug}/dispatches
POST   /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}/lines
PUT    /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}/lines/{lid}
DELETE /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}/lines/{lid}
POST   /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}/post
POST   /{tenantSlug}/dispatches/{id}/void
Permissions: DISPATCHES_VIEW, DISPATCHES_CREATE, DISPATCHES_EDIT, DISPATCHES_POST, DISPATCHES_VOID

