In the movement rows where sourceDocumentId is non-null, show a small "Source" chip (e.g. "Receipt", "Dispatch", "Count"). Make it a clickable link that navigates to the corresponding document page (e.g. PATHS.TENANT.receipts(tenantSlug) with the ID in state or as a query param).
The chip text is derived from the movement type: RECEIVE → Receipt, PICK → Dispatch, ADJUST with sourceDocumentId → Count Session.
