Merge Suggestions
If you want to reduce total sessions from 16 to 14, combine these without risk of context overload:

C2-A + C3-A → one backend session (both are small, independent schema changes, no shared code)
C2-B + C3-B → one frontend session (both are small UI additions to InventoryPage.tsx, same file)
Do not combine any other pairs — C4 through C6 are each large enough to fill a session on their own.